<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in March 19 wk.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in March 19 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED MARCH 12</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............802,400 down...2,100</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......700,300 down...1,900</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......539,000 down...3,900</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED MARCH 19</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....827,734 up ....5,324</p>
<p> Financial companies.......639,484 up.....2,610</p>
<p> New York business loans....45,533 up.......593</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......45,273 up.......603</p>
</text>
